            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MsDanie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm sorry, but both my husband and myself, did NOT like this dip. I will say neither one of us care for american cheese, but I thought with the meat, and peppers that it would be okay. I was wrong. Maybe it will work with a different type of cheese.",
